{"title":"Holiday Glam","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cem\u003eGlam Décor Curated Collection\u003c\/em\u003e from Carol's Christmas Conifers brings a touch of elegance and sparkle to your festive decor. If you’re searching for a sophisticated, glittering Christmas aesthetic, this collection has been curated by our design experts to showcase pieces that radiate glamour and luxury. Featuring beautiful, flocked artificial trees and shimmering metallic ornaments, this collection transforms your home into a dazzling winter wonderland.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGlamorous Handpicked Selection\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOur design team carefully selected each item in the Glam Décor Collection to reflect the glitz and elegance of a glamorous Christmas celebration. Whether you're decorating with silver, gold, or a mix of chic metallics, this collection has everything you need to create a look that is both luxurious and festive. From the sparkle of shimmering ornaments to the sophisticated glow of pre-lit Christmas trees, this curated selection is perfect for those who want to elevate their holiday decor with a bit of shine.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eShop Glam in One Place\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eNo need to search endlessly for the perfect pieces to complete your glam holiday look. With the Glam Décor Handpicked Collection, we’ve done the work for you, gathering all the essential elements to create a chic Christmas theme in one place. From shimmering ribbons to glamorous ornaments and striking artificial trees, we offer everything you need to create a cohesive and elegant Christmas aesthetic.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Glam, Effortless Setup\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOur artificial trees are designed to be as stunning as they are easy to set up. With both pre-lit and unlit options available, these trees offer convenience and sophistication in one package. Adorn them with our collection’s sparkling ornaments to make a statement, or use them as a backdrop for your existing glamorous decor. Every tree and accessory is crafted to provide long-lasting beauty, allowing you to celebrate the season in style year after year.\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"glass-sweet-ornament-set-pink","title":"Sweet 30-Piece Glass Ornament Set (Pink - Purple) Limited Edition","description":"\u003cp\u003eSugar spice and everything nice with this candy-coated 30-piece hand blown ornament set. Make your tree a sweet delight with our candy-coated inspired arrangement. With an assortment of different shapes, sizes, colors, and textures, this exclusive KOC Collection set will surely give your tree a desired modern look. This sweet themed glass ornament set comes packaged in a velvet lined box, carefully molded to each ornament for safe storage.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":30092517802048,"sku":"R0T7R3","price":89.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/keriannbritt--styled-for-the-season--2025-12-01-08-08-12--instagram.jpg?v=1765556819"},{"product_id":"4-pack-diamond","title":"White Diamond Ornament (4 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWe see you. You have an eye for style and creation. When you want to take your centerpiece to the next level, look no further than our 4-piece White Diamond hand blown ornament set. With an exclusive design that is unlike anything else, this refined ornament set will be the highlight of your centerpiece and the topic of many conversations. These unique pieces feature a white base highlighted by diamond shaped silver accents. This gorgeous glass ornament set comes packaged in a velvet lined box, carefully molded to each ornament for safe storage season after season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42319137243336,"sku":"OR4-WHTDI","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/4PackDiamondwhite.jpg?v=1714663317"},{"product_id":"rosegold-frozen-branch-picks","title":"Rosegold Frozen Branch Picks (12 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eMix in a touch of icy wintry beauty with a set of our Rose Gold Frozen Branch Picks. With a metallic\n\u003cbr\u003eambiance highlighted by elegant splashes of rose gold, these picks inject that traditional glittery semblance into to your holiday décor, creating a shimmering atmosphere that sparks the best memories. 12 picks are\n\u003cbr\u003eincluded for endless possibilities!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42332373024968,"sku":"PK12-ROSEG","price":89.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2022TreePickFlatLayFinal-21.jpg?v=1718159334"},{"product_id":"netted-ribbon","title":"Netted Stretch Ribbon (10 yards)","description":"\u003cp\u003eYour must-have décor is here. Whether you’re putting the finishing touches on your centerpiece, wrapping your\n\u003cbr\u003ewreaths, accessorizing gift boxes, or seeking to add a quick splash of Holiday elegance to that space that needs just a bit more, a little ribbon can go a long way. Our sparkling Netted Ribbon offers that final touch that will instantly complement any color theme in style. 10 yards in length, the decorating possibilities are truly endless. Upgrade your décor arsenal today with a roll of versatile Netted Ribbon.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42345660481736,"sku":"RB-NETTED","price":49.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/NettedStretchRibbon_10yards.jpg?v=1714674628"},{"product_id":"15-pack-silver-gold-glass-ornament","title":"Mixed Metals 15-Piece Glass Ornament Set (Silver-Gold)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday traditions, hanging the ornaments with your loved ones sparks some of the most memorable moments of the season. That means you can’t just settle for any ordinary ornaments. Each Limited Edition Mistletoe Glass Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 15 distinctly designed pieces offering an elegant metallic blend of silvers and golds; this gorgeous set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that demands attention and stands out from the rest.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946036367560,"sku":"JEJ9W8W","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/MixedMetals15pieceglassornamentset.png?v=1714674598"},{"product_id":"48-pack-glimmer-shatterproof","title":"Gold Glimmer Shatterproof Ornaments (48 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhether you have kids, cats, or simply want that extra peace of mind when hanging or storing your ornament collection, you can’t go wrong with the unmatched durability of a beautiful shatterproof set. Each Gold Glimmer Shatterproof Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 48 shatterproof pieces offering a luxurious blend of gloss, matte, and glittery golds, this lovely set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that not only demands attention but also withstands any attacks from your furry friends or little ones!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946036662472,"sku":"SXA4L6W","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/GoldGlimmerShatterproofOrnaments.png?v=1714671295"},{"product_id":"12-pack-gold-accents","title":"Gold Accents Glass Ornament Set (12 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday traditions, hanging the ornaments with your loved ones sparks some of the most memorable moments of the season. That means you can’t just settle for any ordinary ornaments. Each Gold Accents Glass Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 12 distinctively designed pieces offering an elegant blend of glamorous golds; this unique set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that demands attention and stands out from the rest.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e*Pairs perfectly with our Silver Accents Ornament Set (12 Pack).\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946036793544,"sku":"JMF2K4E","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Untitleddesign_17.png?v=1771956501"},{"product_id":"12-pack-silver-accents","title":"Silver Accents Glass Ornament Set (12 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday traditions, hanging the ornaments with your loved ones sparks some of the most memorable moments of the season. That means you can’t just settle for any ordinary ornaments. Each Silver Accents Glass Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the priceless memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 12 distinctively designed pieces offering an elegant blend of stunning silvers; this unique set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that demands attention and stands out from the rest.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e*Pairs perfectly with our Gold Accents Ornament Set (12 Pack).\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":4294603682