Title","offer_id":42946036891848,"sku":"UBD7D3W","price":69.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingOfChristmas2025_BrookePavelPhoto010.jpg?v=1765556005"},{"product_id":"6-pack-silver-frosted","title":"Silver Frosted Ornament Set (6 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday traditions, hanging the ornaments with your loved ones sparks some of the most memorable moments of the season. That means you can’t just settle for any ordinary ornaments. Each Silver Frosted Glass Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the priceless memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 6 distinctively designed pieces offering a gorgeous, frosty blend of silver and white, this unique set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that demands attention and stands out from the rest.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946036990152,"sku":"FRP2S9R","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Final11.png?v=1714662353"},{"product_id":"8-pack-bubbles","title":"Bubbles Glass Ornament Set (8 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday traditions, hanging the ornaments with your loved ones sparks some of the most memorable moments of the season. That means you can’t just settle for any ordinary ornaments. Each Bubbles Glass Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the priceless memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 8 pieces offering a beautiful semblance of white and clear bubbles, this unique set gives you the perfect final touch for a fun centerpiece that demands attention and stands out from the rest.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037022920,"sku":"LPV6W4V","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/bubbleornaments.png?v=1771956473"},{"product_id":"6-pack-silver-nutcracker","title":"Silver Nutcracker Glass Ornament Set (6 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday traditions, hanging the ornaments with your loved ones sparks some of the most memorable moments of the season. That means you can’t just settle for any ordinary ornaments. Each Silver Nutcracker Glass Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the priceless memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 6 silver pieces offering a classic vibe inside a timeless holiday staple, this must-have set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that demands attention and stands out from the rest.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037219528,"sku":"ELZ7T7Y","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/SilverNutcrackercopy.png?v=1722013746"},{"product_id":"gold-glitter-ribbon","title":"Gold Glitter Ribbon (10 Yards)","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the spirit of the holidays into your home with\n\u003cbr\u003eGold Glitter Ribbon from Carol's Christmas Conifers. Made\n\u003cbr\u003ewith sparkling glitter accents, this elegant gold\n\u003cbr\u003eribbon exudes a festive sheen and is perfect for\n\u003cbr\u003ethat traditional Christmas setting that will instill\n\u003cbr\u003ethe best memories season after season.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you’re putting the finishing touches on\n\u003cbr\u003eyour centerpiece, wrapping your wreaths,\n\u003cbr\u003eaccessorizing gift boxes, or seeking to add a quick\n\u003cbr\u003esplash of holiday magic to that space that needs\n\u003cbr\u003ejust a bit more love, a little ribbon can go a long\n\u003cbr\u003eway.\n\u003cbr\u003eWith a generous 10 yards in length, the decorating\n\u003cbr\u003epossibilities are truly endless. Let your creativity\n\u003cbr\u003erun wild and bring your Christmas dreams to life\n\u003cbr\u003ethis holiday season with a roll of the distinguished\n\u003cbr\u003eGold Glitter Ribbon.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037448904,"sku":"FNM3S2J","price":49.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/P1020184copy.png?v=1714674770"},{"product_id":"gold-mesh-ribbon","title":"Gold Mesh Ribbon (10 Yards)","description":"\u003cp\u003eDetails matter when it comes to creating a\n\u003cbr\u003ememorable Christmas setting. And what better way\n\u003cbr\u003eto dress up your holiday décor than with our\n\u003cbr\u003edistinctively designed Gold Mesh Ribbon. This\n\u003cbr\u003eelegant and unique ribbon offers a mesh effect that\n\u003cbr\u003eadds an extra touch of detail to your oasis, creating\n\u003cbr\u003ea glowing ambiance that your family and guests will\n\u003cbr\u003etruly appreciate.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you’re putting the finishing touches on\n\u003cbr\u003eyour centerpiece, wrapping your wreaths,\n\u003cbr\u003eaccessorizing gift boxes, or seeking to add a quick\n\u003cbr\u003esplash of holiday magic to that space that needs\n\u003cbr\u003ejust a bit more love, a little ribbon can go a long\n\u003cbr\u003eway.\n\u003cbr\u003eWith a generous 10 yards in length, the decorating\n\u003cbr\u003epossibilities are truly endless. Let your creativity\n\u003cbr\u003erun wild and bring your Christmas dreams to life\n\u003cbr\u003ethis holiday season with a roll of the distinguished\n\u003cbr\u003eGold Mesh Ribbon.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037514440,"sku":"DQB3F6S","price":49.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/GoldMeshRibbon.png?v=1714671309"},{"product_id":"silver-burst-picks","title":"Silver Burst Picks (12 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eSometimes you don’t know you need something\n\u003cbr\u003euntil you see it, like an elegant set of Silver Burst\n\u003cbr\u003ePicks. With a sparkling beauty that will bring joy to\n\u003cbr\u003eyou and your guests for years to come, these picks\n\u003cbr\u003eare the holiday accent that can fit in virtually\n\u003cbr\u003eanywhere. Infuse your holiday decorations with a\n\u003cbr\u003esparkling burst of silvery holiday magic.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you want to add some extra flair to your\n\u003cbr\u003ecenterpiece or inject some dimension to your\n\u003cbr\u003ewreath, garland, or tabletop display, you can’t go\n\u003cbr\u003ewrong with a stylish set of elegant holiday picks.\n\u003cbr\u003eGrab a set of 12 Silver Burst Picks for your space\n\u003cbr\u003etoday, and let your creativity run wild.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037579976,"sku":"EDS6Y5T","price":69.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/SilverBurstPicks_12Pack.png?v=1722013727"},{"product_id":"sphere-glass-ornament","title":"Sphere Glass Ornament Set (6 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eCreate the perfect holiday atmosphere this\n\u003cbr\u003eChristmas with the Sphere Glass Ornament Set!\n\u003cbr\u003eTransform your home into a winter wonderland\n\u003cbr\u003ewith these six teardrop-shaped glass ornaments\n\u003cbr\u003ethat measure 7 inches long. Each ornament is filled\n\u003cbr\u003ewith festive cheer, perfectly encapsulating the joy\n\u003cbr\u003eof the season. Hang them on your tree or around\n\u003cbr\u003ethe house to spread some holiday spirit in your\n\u003cbr\u003ehome! The whimsical design emits an aura of\n\u003cbr\u003echarm and elegance for any room. Give your living\n\u003cbr\u003espace an extra dose of seasonal magic this year\n\u003cbr\u003ewith the Sphere Glass Ornament Set!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42965630812360,"sku":"SMG9Q3V","price":69.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/SphereOrnaments1.png?v=1722013853"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/collections\/IMG_0993.jpg?v=1760625668","url":"/\/collections\/glam-decor.oembed","provider":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","version":"1.0","type":"link"}